          "type": "ai_gen_block_1eda252",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
            "subheading": "Find answers to common questions about Flowlines",
            "heading_alignment": "center",
            "heading_spacing": 40,
            "faq_1_question": "Do I need any drawing experience?",
            "faq_1_answer": "<p>No drawing experience is required! Flowlines is designed for everyone, from complete beginners to experienced artists. The projection guides you step-by-step.</p>",
            "faq_2_question": "Does Flowlines work on real paper?",
            "faq_2_answer": "<p>Yes! Flowlines projects directly onto any paper surface, canvas, or drawing medium. You create real, physical artwork that you can keep, frame, or gift.</p>",
            "faq_3_question": "What materials do I need?",
            "faq_3_answer": "<p>You'll need the Flowlines device, paper or canvas, and your choice of drawing tools (pencils, markers, paints, etc.). </p>",
            "faq_4_question": "Can kids use it?",
            "faq_4_answer": "<p>Flowlines is designed to make drawing approachable. For children, we recommend adult guidance and supervision. Please refer to the final product guidance for age recommendations.</p>",
            "faq_5_question": "Is this an AI image generator?",
            "faq_5_answer": "<p>No, Flowlines is not an AI generator. It's a smart projection tool that helps you create real, hand-drawn artwork. You're the artist—Flowlines just guides you.</p>",
            "faq_6_question": "When will Flowlines be available?",
            "faq_6_answer": "<p>Flowlines is in development. Join our waitlist for updates on availability and future launch announcements.</p>",
            "faq_7_question": "Can I join as an early tester?",
            "faq_7_answer": "<p>Join the waitlist to hear about future testing opportunities and product updates.<br/><br/></p>",
